# Persistent, LaunchAgent-scheduled sync scripts — everything else in
# scripts/ is scratch/throwaway and stays ignored, but these two keep a
# local Desktop copy of every sent report/invoice current and must
# survive being treated as disposable (confirmed live 2026-08-27: the
# report sync silently broke for ~18h after its script got deleted as
# if it were scratch work).
!scripts/sync-final-reports.mts
!scripts/sync-final-reports.sh
!scripts/sync-final-invoices.mts
!scripts/sync-final-invoices.sh
!scripts/tsconfig.sync.json
supabase/.temp/
